WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.800
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:07.210
SPEAKER: Welcome to
the quickstart tutorial

00:00:07.210 --> 00:00:09.820
for Google Cloud VPC.

00:00:09.820 --> 00:00:15.280
On the VPC network page,
select Create VPC Network.

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:20.060
For name, type in auto-network1.

00:00:20.060 --> 00:00:24.020
Under subnet creation
mode, select Automatic.

00:00:24.020 --> 00:00:25.880
Then, click Create.

00:00:25.880 --> 00:00:28.680
The auto network
will now be created.

00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:30.440
Let's create a custom network.

00:00:30.440 --> 00:00:35.960
Create new network by clicking
on Create VPC Network again.

00:00:35.960 --> 00:00:39.920
Under the name, type
custom-network1.

00:00:39.920 --> 00:00:42.750
Click on the Add Subnet button.

00:00:42.750 --> 00:00:47.000
Under name, type
subnet-us-central-192.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:51.740
Select us-central1
as the region.

00:00:51.740 --> 00:00:58.640
In the IP address,
type 192.168.1.0/24.

00:00:58.640 --> 00:01:00.860
Select Add Subnet button again.

00:01:00.860 --> 00:01:05.960
Under name, type
subnet-europe-west-192.

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:08.750
Select europe-west1
as the region.

00:01:08.750 --> 00:01:16.140
And type the IP address
as 192.168.5.0/24.

00:01:16.140 --> 00:01:19.060
Now, select Add
Subnet one more time.

00:01:19.060 --> 00:01:24.650
Under name, type
subnet-asia-east-192.

00:01:24.650 --> 00:01:27.770
Select asia-east1 as the region.

00:01:27.770 --> 00:01:35.210
And type the IP address
as 192.168.7.0/24.

00:01:35.210 --> 00:01:36.920
Select Create.

00:01:36.920 --> 00:01:40.610
Congratulations, you've now
created a custom network

00:01:40.610 --> 00:01:42.530
and an automatic VPC network.

00:01:42.530 --> 00:01:45.880
[MUSIC PLAYING]

